%
O8002 (WARMUP M2 EXTENDED)
(WARM-UP FOR MACHINE M2 - 3-AXIS VMC, 1016 X 660 X 500 MM TRAVEL)
(PROFILE EXTENDED - AFTER THE SPINDLE HAS BEEN IDLE FOR SEVERAL DAYS HAAS)
(- MORE THAN 4)
(GENERATED BY CNC-WARMUP 0.1.0. DO NOT EDIT BY HAND - REGENERATE INSTEAD.)
(SPINDLE 500-10000 RPM, FEED 2000-12000 MM/MIN, 6 STAGES, GEOMETRIC RAMP)
(COOLANT OFF, EDGE MARGIN 1 MM, EST. RUN TIME 29M58S PLUS POSITIONING)
(SWEEP ENVELOPE - X -1015 TO -1, Y -659 TO -1, Z -499 TO -1)
(MOVES USE G53 MACHINE COORDINATES, AND G91 INCREMENTS FROM POINTS JUST)
(REACHED WITH G53, SO WORK OFFSETS AND TOOL LENGTH DO NOT APPLY.)
(RESTART ONLY AT A STAGE N-NUMBER - THE SWEEP PASSES ARE INCREMENTAL.)
(STAGE     RPM    FEED  PASSES  DWELL   TIME)
(    1     500    2000       1   61 S   5M00S)
(    2     910    2860       1  132 S   4M59S)
(    3    1660    4100       2   66 S   4M59S)
(    4    3020    5860       3   55 S   5M00S)
(    5    5490    8390       5   15 S   5M00S)
(    6   10000   12000       7   21 S   5M00S)
(--- SAFE START - SPINDLE AND COOLANT OFF ---)
G21 (METRIC - AT THE START, BEFORE ANY COORDINATES)
G17 G40 G49 G80 G90 G94 (XY PLANE, NO CUTTER/LENGTH COMP, NO CANNED CYCLE, ABSOLUTE, MM/MIN)
G69 (CANCEL COORDINATE SYSTEM ROTATION)
M05 (SPINDLE OFF)
M09 (COOLANT OFF)
(--- TRAVEL CHECK - THE SOFT LIMITS OF THE CONTROL MUST CONTAIN THE SWEEP ---)
(PARAMETERS 1320 AND 1321 HOLD THE + AND - STROKE LIMITS. READING THEM)
(NEEDS CUSTOM MACRO AND PRM, 30I-B OR LATER.)
IF [PRM[1321]/[1] GT -1015.] THEN #3000=1(SWEEP EXCEEDS X- LIMIT)
IF [PRM[1320]/[1] LT -1.] THEN #3000=1(SWEEP EXCEEDS X+ LIMIT)
IF [PRM[1321]/[2] GT -659.] THEN #3000=1(SWEEP EXCEEDS Y- LIMIT)
IF [PRM[1320]/[2] LT -1.] THEN #3000=1(SWEEP EXCEEDS Y+ LIMIT)
IF [PRM[1321]/[3] GT -499.] THEN #3000=1(SWEEP EXCEEDS Z- LIMIT)
IF [PRM[1320]/[3] LT -1.] THEN #3000=1(SWEEP EXCEEDS Z+ LIMIT)
(--- OPERATOR CHECK ---)
(BEFORE CYCLE START, CHECK)
(- TABLE CLEAR - NO PART, FIXTURE OR VISE ANYWHERE IN THE TRAVEL)
(- SPINDLE EMPTY - NO TOOL IN THE SPINDLE)
(- DOORS CLOSED)
(- FEED AND SPINDLE OVERRIDES AT 100 PERCENT)
M00 (PRESS CYCLE START TO RUN THE WARM-UP)
